{"4123310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fields of Cascadia", "steam_appid": 4123310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c2cb3a3d9ea1a710692e5fcb09750205.avif?t=1783281140\" width=902 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find your place in the world starting in the safety of the walls of the city.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of work can be found with the established artisan's guilds - teachers of crafting, martial, or survival skills can be found with a little persistence. By hook or by crook, build your wealth and influence and you'll gain the attention of both the greater and lesser rulers of the land and the people hoping to live a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hope for the best, prepare for the worst</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare carefully for forays into the wilderness as hunger, sickness, and the climate can have disastrous effects on your expedition. Be sure to find ways to test your mettle before diving too deep and finding yourself unprepared for combat. There's no shame in realizing that retreat is your best option, especially if you can realize it early enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Carve out a piece of land and have your say</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is rich in resources and is thoroughly spoken for by various rulers' claims. Whether through military might or the grant of a local lord, you can establish your own settlement and help your settlers grow their village into a formidable city. Settlers will come and join promising towns, bringing their labor and economic activity. And with more people comes more needs for housing, varied food production, entertainment, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become the hand that tips the scales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The established cities and their rulers have their own motivations. As you gain notoriety, whether as an accomplished guild member, infamous mercenary, or champion of the people, these rulers will be interested in your help to further their goals. Decide whether their cause is worthwhile to pursue, or burn it all down and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the frontier of a living world, the inhabitants of city-states conduct business and travel between cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure alone or cooperatively, with split-screen and also supporting dual monitor setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook luxury food items which hold great utility for morale and are consequently pricey or require skill to prepare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artisan skills and guild membership allow opening shops. A low maintenance shop system keeps your shop gameplay from becoming burdensome: switch gears and leave on an adventure with no adverse effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighty, decisive combat, friendly fire makes encounters hectic if initiated without planning and forethought</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC factions vie for power, world conditions and interactions influence their strategies and initiatives</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c2cb3a3d9ea1a710692e5fcb09750205.avif?t=1783281140\" width=902 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find your place in the world starting in the safety of the walls of the city.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of work can be found with the established artisan's guilds - teachers of crafting, martial, or survival skills can be found with a little persistence. By hook or by crook, build your wealth and influence and you'll gain the attention of both the greater and lesser rulers of the land and the people hoping to live a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/acb4b0f7b01eb11626b8387848863c6e.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hope for the best, prepare for the worst</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare carefully for forays into the wilderness as hunger, sickness, and the climate can have disastrous effects on your expedition. Be sure to find ways to test your mettle before diving too deep and finding yourself unprepared for combat. There's no shame in realizing that retreat is your best option, especially if you can realize it early enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/10083fc1d8213f60a4d31e75b9da6cce.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Carve out a piece of land and have your say</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is rich in resources and is thoroughly spoken for by various rulers' claims. Whether through military might or the grant of a local lord, you can establish your own settlement and help your settlers grow their village into a formidable city. Settlers will come and join promising towns, bringing their labor and economic activity. And with more people comes more needs for housing, varied food production, entertainment, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/c55ce1cb63bbd8954b9f99839a4348f7.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become the hand that tips the scales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The established cities and their rulers have their own motivations. As you gain notoriety, whether as an accomplished guild member, infamous mercenary, or champion of the people, these rulers will be interested in your help to further their goals. Decide whether their cause is worthwhile to pursue, or burn it all down and start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.poster.avif?t=1783281140\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.webm?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/extras/e8131da211967d4121f8d3273d2d4908.mp4?t=1783281140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the frontier of a living world, the inhabitants of city-states conduct business and travel between cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure alone or cooperatively, with split-screen and also supporting dual monitor setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook luxury food items which hold great utility for morale and are consequently pricey or require skill to prepare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artisan skills and guild membership allow opening shops. A low maintenance shop system keeps your shop gameplay from becoming burdensome: switch gears and leave on an adventure with no adverse effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighty, decisive combat, friendly fire makes encounters hectic if initiated without planning and forethought</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC factions vie for power, world conditions and interactions influence their strategies and initiatives</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore a land of scattered ruins and city-states. Find your place as a shopkeeper or artisan in the city, or venture into the frontier with a friend in co-op. Prepare carefully as hunger, low spirits, and the bitter cold can doom an expedition. Meanwhile, petty rulers have their own motives...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/9bf272b3b957977c3064fa80fbe5e383fc135f1d/header.jpg?t=1783281140", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/4924a44c951a5e61be27cda9e3e58d2d6ab693cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783281140", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123310/4924a44c951a5e61be27cda9e3e58d2d6ab693cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783281140", "website": "https://www.indiedb.com/games/fieldsofcascadia", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 CPUs), ~3.1GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics 520<br></